{"product":{"id":6236193063100,"title":"Norix Attenda Anti-Ligature Space-Saver Bed – ATN120 \/ ATN130 \/ ATN150","body_html":"\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003eNorix Attenda Anti-Ligature Space-Saver Bed\u003c\/strong\u003e has a smaller footprint than the standard Attenda Platform Bed, which leaves more open floor space in resident rooms. It comes in floor-mount and free-standing versions, and its seamless molded shape is designed to be ligature resistant.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThere are three sizes. The ATN120 fits a 29” × 77” mattress and the ATN150 fits a 30” × 79” mattress. The ATN130 adds a storage cubby under the bed deck that is made to fit Norix Citadel property storage boxes, sold separately. Each bed is rotationally molded from high-impact polyethylene, filled with rigid polyurethane foam, and tested to a 1,000 lb static load.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eConstruction:\u003c\/strong\u003e Rotationally molded high-impact polyethylene with UV stabilizers, filled with rigid polyurethane foam\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDesign:\u003c\/strong\u003e Seamless molded shape with no internal openings\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMattress Sizes:\u003c\/strong\u003e 29” × 77” (ATN120), 30” × 79” (ATN150), 30” × 75” (ATN130)\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWeight:\u003c\/strong\u003e 80 lbs (ATN120), 85 lbs (ATN150), 140 lbs (ATN130)\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eColors:\u003c\/strong\u003e Twilight, Cove, Sand, Sienna, Dove\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eStatic Load Testing:\u003c\/strong\u003e Tested to 1,000 lbs\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eFlammability Standards:\u003c\/strong\u003e California Technical Bulletin 133 and 117, UL 1056, ASTM E1537, and NFPA 261\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eEnvironmental Certification:\u003c\/strong\u003e GREENGUARD and GREENGUARD Gold\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWarranty:\u003c\/strong\u003e 10-year limited replacement warranty\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eIntended Use:\u003c\/strong\u003e Indoor use only\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCountry of Manufacture:\u003c\/strong\u003e USA\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAvailable Models and Options\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eATN120 – Floor-Mount Bed:\u003c\/strong\u003e 79” L × 31” W × 15” H, bed deck 77” × 29”, 80 lbs\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eATN123 – Free-Standing Bed:\u003c\/strong\u003e Same size as ATN120, no mounting holes, 80 lbs\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eATN150 – Floor-Mount Bed:\u003c\/strong\u003e 80” L × 32” W × 15” H, bed deck 78” × 30”, 85 lbs\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eATN153 – Free-Standing Bed:\u003c\/strong\u003e Same size as ATN150, no mounting holes, 85 lbs\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eATN130 – Floor-Mount Bed with Storage:\u003c\/strong\u003e 78” L × 32” W × 22.6” H, bed deck 76” × 30”, storage cubby 27” W × 18” D × 15” H, 140 lbs\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eATN133 – Free-Standing Bed with Storage:\u003c\/strong\u003e Same size as ATN130, no mounting holes, 140 lbs\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eInstallation and Options\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eFloor-Mounted Installation:\u003c\/strong\u003e Wedge anchors and 3\/8” bolts are required and are not supplied by Norix. A groove along the underside edge accepts security caulk (caulk not supplied).\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eTamper-Resistant Glides:\u003c\/strong\u003e Optional for the floor-mount models (ATN120, ATN150, and ATN130)\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAssembly:\u003c\/strong\u003e None required\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eApplications\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Norix Attenda Space-Saver Bed suits smaller resident rooms where open floor space, ligature resistance, and easy cleaning are important considerations.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTypical applications include:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003eBehavioral healthcare facilities and psychiatric hospitals\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003eCorrectional and detention facilities\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003eOther supervised residential and institutional settings\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eExplore Anchortex's \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/www.anchortex.com\/collections\/bh-behavioral-healthcare-furniture\"\u003eBehavioral Healthcare Anti-Ligature Furniture\u003c\/a\u003e and \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/www.anchortex.com\/collections\/cd-correctional-furniture\"\u003ePrison and Detention Furniture\u003c\/a\u003e collections for more institutional furniture.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eAbout Norix Attenda Molded Bedroom Series\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Norix Attenda Series is a line of molded bedroom furniture for behavioral healthcare and correctional facilities. It includes beds, nightstands, open chests, desks, a stool, wall-mounted storage units, and a wardrobe, all molded from high-impact polyethylene in a clean, contemporary style. Each piece is designed to attach flush to the wall or floor.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCommon characteristics of the Attenda Series include:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMolded Construction:\u003c\/strong\u003e Rotationally molded high-impact polyethylene with smooth, rounded edges\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eLigature-Resistant Design:\u003c\/strong\u003e Molded shapes without pass-throughs or tie-off points to help reduce ligature risk\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eContraband-Resistant Design:\u003c\/strong\u003e No creases or nooks, which helps reduce places to hide contraband\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eEasy Cleaning:\u003c\/strong\u003e Chemically resistant surfaces that can be cleaned with bleach solutions and hospital-grade disinfectants\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eTruColor™ Technology:\u003c\/strong\u003e Fully compounded color for a consistent finish without streaks or speckles\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eAbout Norix Furniture\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNorix manufactures durable furniture for demanding environments, including behavioral healthcare facilities, psychiatric hospitals, correctional institutions, and residential treatment centers. Explore the full line of \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/www.anchortex.com\/collections\/norix-furniture\"\u003eNorix Furniture\u003c\/a\u003e at Anchortex.\u003c\/p\u003e","vendor":"Norix","product_type":"","created_at":"2021-01-29T13:18:28-05:00","handle":"norix-atn-attenda-space-saver-bed","updated_at":"2026-11-26T18:27:33-05:00","published_at":"2021-01-29T13:18:28-05:00","template_suffix":"","published_scope":"web","tags":"Behavioral Healthcare Furniture, bh-behavioral-health-care-furniture-patient-rooms, cd-furn-cell, norix-attenda, Prison-Furniture","variants":[{"id":37961016017084,"product_id":6236193063100,"title":"ATN120 - Floor-Mount Bed (31Wx79L) \/ None","price":"1884.80","sku":"N700193-01","position":1,"compare_at_price":"2356.00","fulfillment_service":"manual","inventory_management":"shopify","option1":"ATN120 - Floor-Mount Bed (31Wx79L)","option2":"None","option3":null,"created_at":"2021-01-29T13:18:29-05:00","updated_at":"2026-11-26T18:27:33-05:00","taxable":true,"barcode":"-","grams":36287,"image_id":null,"weight":80.0,"weight_unit":"lb","requires_shipping":true,"quantity_rule":{"min":1,"max":null,"increment":1},"price_currency":"USD","compare_at_price_currency":"USD","quantity_price_breaks"